  "notes": "登录与连接更可靠。\n\n- iOS：切换账号时旧连接无法确认停止不再拒绝登录；会提示如何手动关闭旧连接，并按真实原因显示登录错误。\n- iOS：自签安装缺少 App Group 时准确提示原因，并直接给出安装指引。\n- Windows：TUN 模式接管默认路由，不再被其他网卡的默认路由抢走流量；诊断检查实际生效的路由。\n",
  "notesEn": "More reliable sign-in and connections.\n\n- iOS: signing in no longer fails when the previous connection cannot be confirmed as stopped; the app explains how to turn the old connection off and reports sign-in errors by their real cause.\n- iOS: sideloaded installs missing the App Group now show the exact cause together with the install guide.\n- Windows: TUN mode takes over the default route so another adapter's default route can no longer bypass it; diagnostics check the route actually in effect.\n",
